<title>USA: CBOT soy weaken on commission house sales, weather.</title>
<headline>CBOT soy weaken on commission house sales, weather.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>After climbing as much as seven cents per bushel in early trade, a wave of commission house selling caused July soybeans to briefly turn lower before rebounding slightly, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;Stern sold a million and then we went through some (sell) stops,&quot; said one floor trader.</p>
</text>
